{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"苏轼·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"su-shi","categoryLabel":"苏轼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/26_su-shi/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"苏轼-生平与时代-简介\">苏轼·生平与时代 — 简介</h1><p>本 hub 回答一个问题：<strong>苏轼（1037–1101）的一生是怎样走过来的，以及他所处的北宋党争时代如何塑造了他？</strong> 这里讲的是<strong>履历与际遇</strong>——家世、成名、入狱、贬谪、辞世这条时间线本身，以及它背后的政治背景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>苏轼系列共六个 hub，本 hub 是<strong>时间轴主线</strong>，其余五个是按主题切分的横剖面。读本 hub 你会反复被指向它们去看「展开」，而它们也会回指本 hub 看「何时何地」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本 hub（生平与时代）——<strong>编年的人生轨迹</strong>：他经历了什么。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>——他在文学艺术上<strong>贡献了什么</strong>（全才、豪放词、散文）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>——他用什么<strong>人生哲学</strong>面对苦难（旷达、三教融通）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要作品</a>——他写了哪些<strong>具体作品</strong>（赤壁赋、寒食帖等）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>——他<strong>死后近千年</strong>如何被纪念、传播。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>——如何<strong>严谨地评价</strong>他（政治得失、深浅之辩）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>边界原则：本 hub 只在时间线上<strong>点到</strong>某事件的意义，<strong>不展开</strong>其文学/思想分析——遇到「赤壁赋有多伟大」「旷达哲学的内核」之类问题，一律交叉链接到对应兄弟 hub，避免重复展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 内部按时间顺序读即可，三章六篇构成完整轨迹：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[&quot;1·眉山神童&lt;br/&gt;家世+成名&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2·贬谪生涯&lt;br/&gt;乌台诗案+黄州&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;3·最后岁月&lt;br/&gt;海南+辞世&quot;]\">graph LR\n  A[\"1·眉山神童&lt;br/&gt;家世+成名\"] --&gt; B[\"2·贬谪生涯&lt;br/&gt;乌台诗案+黄州\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"3·最后岁月&lt;br/&gt;海南+辞世\"]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>眉山神童</strong>——<a href=\"a-prodigy-from-meishan/the-su-family\">眉山苏家</a>（家世与人格养成）→<a href=\"a-prodigy-from-meishan/early-success\">早年成名</a>（1057 进士、欧阳修赏识）。</li>\n<li><strong>贬谪生涯</strong>——<a href=\"a-career-of-exile/the-wutai-poetry-case\">乌台诗案</a>（1079 文字狱、人生转折）→<a href=\"a-career-of-exile/huangzhou-and-beyond\">黄州与贬谪</a>（「东坡」诞生、宦海浮沉全轨迹）。</li>\n<li><strong>最后岁月</strong>——<a href=\"the-final-years/furthest-exile-hainan\">远谪海南</a>（1097 最远之贬、开海南文教）→<a href=\"the-final-years/death-and-legacy\">辞世与不朽</a>（1101 卒于常州、不朽地位总括）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置与读法\">前置与读法</h2><p>无硬性前置知识。若对北宋「新旧党争」「熙宁变法」陌生，本 hub 各篇均已就地给出最小背景，无需另读。建议初次接触苏轼者<strong>从本 hub 入手</strong>（先建立时间框架），再按兴趣进入兄弟 hub 的主题深挖——时间线是理解其余一切的脚手架。</p>\n<p>贯穿本 hub 的一条主线值得提前点明：苏轼的伟大与坎坷<strong>同源</strong>——成就他的才华、人格与时代，正是把他一再抛向贬谪深谷的同一组力量；而他每一次的精神升华，恰恰发生在被推向绝境之时（「问汝平生功业，黄州惠州儋州」）。带着这条线索读，整部生平便不再是流水账，而是一个「以苦难淬炼自我」的完整故事。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-prodigy-from-meishan","title":"A Prodigy From Meishan","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-prodigy-from-meishan","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-su-family","title":"眉山苏家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-prodigy-from-meishan/the-su-family"},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-success","title":"早年成名","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-prodigy-from-meishan/early-success"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-career-of-exile","title":"A Career Of Exile","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-career-of-exile","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-wutai-poetry-case","title":"乌台诗案","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/the-wutai-poetry-case"},{"seq":2,"slug":"huangzhou-and-beyond","title":"黄州与贬谪","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/huangzhou-and-beyond"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-final-years","title":"The Final Years","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/the-final-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"furthest-exile-hainan","title":"远谪海南","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/the-final-years/furthest-exile-hainan"},{"seq":2,"slug":"death-and-legacy","title":"辞世与不朽","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/life-and-times/the-final-years/death-and-legacy"}]}]}